Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libyal/libvmdk

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libyal/libvmdk/archive/refs/tags/20260714.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libvmdk-20260714-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libvmdk-20260714-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libvmdk-20260714-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libvmdk-20260714-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libvmdk1-20260714-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libvmdk-devel-20260714-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-libvmdk-20260714-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libvmdk)
  /usr/bin/vmdkinfo.exe
  /usr/bin/vmdkmount.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libvmdk.README
  /usr/share/doc/libvmdk/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libvmdk/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libvmdk/COPYING.LESSER
  /usr/share/doc/libvmdk/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libvmdk/README
  /usr/share/doc/libvmdk/VMWare Virtual Disk Format (VMDK).asciidoc
  /usr/share/man/man1/vmdkinfo.1.gz
  /usr/share/man/man1/vmdkmount.1.gz

(libvmdk1)
  /usr/bin/cygvmdk-1.dll

(libvmdk-devel)
  /usr/include/libvmdk.h
  /usr/include/libvmdk/codepage.h
  /usr/include/libvmdk/definitions.h
  /usr/include/libvmdk/error.h
  /usr/include/libvmdk/extern.h
  /usr/include/libvmdk/features.h
  /usr/include/libvmdk/types.h
  /usr/lib/libvmdk.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libvmdk.pc
  /usr/share/man/man3/libvmdk.3.gz

(python312-libvmdk)
  /usr/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pyvmdk.cpython-312-x86_64-cygwin.dll

